        "original_id": "7ff968b9-5a9c-518d-9c77-519d052b78a2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"All We Ever Knew\", \"Signs of Light\"\n- People: Charity Rose Thielen, Chris Zasche, Kenny Hensley, Tyler Williams\n- Organizations: The Head and the Heart, Warner Bros.\n\nFacts:\n- \"All We Ever Knew\" is a song written and recorded by the American folk band The Head and the Heart.\n- \"All We Ever Knew\" was released as the lead single for The Head and the Heart's third studio album \"Signs of Light\" by Warner Bros.\n- The Head and the Heart includes Charity Rose Thielen on violin, guitar, and vocals.\n- The Head and the Heart includes Chris Zasche on bass.\n- The Head and the Heart includes Kenny Hensley on piano.\n- The Head and the Heart includes Tyler Williams on drums.",
